 "description": "Routine records (#1184, contract 0.1.27). A record is valid when its name is 1 to 60 code points (not UTF-16 units: 60 emoji pass, 61 fail) and not blank (blank-text.json pattern), it has 1 to 50 exercises, each with a non-blank name of 1 to 200 code points, an integer sets from 1 to 20, and at most 20 keys in total; an unlisted key is kept and its value must be a boolean, number, string or null. An exercise group, when present, is null or matches exercise-group.json (exercises.group). Only these fields are checked; id, version, updated_at, deleted_at and created_at follow SyncMeta. The cap section holds the 100-live-routine scenarios. Backend and app tests should load this file.",
